  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal term used in publishing and academic contexts. Often used with する to form a verb ({寄稿|きこう}する). The contributor is called {寄稿者|きこうしゃ}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {寄稿|きこう}する (to contribute an article)\n- {寄稿|きこう}を{依頼|いらい}する (to request a contribution)\n- {寄稿者|きこうしゃ} (contributor)\n- {寄稿|きこう}{記事|きじ} (contributed article)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {投稿|とうこう}: submission, post — broader, includes social media posts, letters to editors, and user-generated content\n- {執筆|しっぴつ}: writing — the act of writing itself, not specifically submitting to a publication",
